  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your free hand wards off attacks with ease.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Snapping Turtle Style<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The shield bonus to AC provided by this style is increased by 1. In addition, as an immediate action you can expend one use of your mythic power to increase your shield bonus to AC by an amount equal to your mythic tier until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc89\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
